# 12. ASSIGN ORDERS  (/api/assign)
# ============================================================

### 12.1 Get all assigned orders
GET {{base}}/api/assign/assigned-orders

###

### 12.2 Assign order to shopper and delivery
POST {{base}}/api/assign/assign
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payment_id": 1,
  "shopper_id": 1,
  "delivery_boy_id": 1
}

###

### 12.3 Get assigned order by payment ID
GET {{base}}/api/assign/assigned-orders/1

###

### 12.4 Update order status
PUT {{base}}/api/assign/assigned-orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "delivered"
}

###

### 12.5 Get orders for a shopper
GET {{base}}/api/assign/assigned-orders/shopper/1

###

### 12.6 Get orders for a delivery boy
GET {{base}}/api/assign/assigned-orders/deliveryboy/1

###

### 12.7 Delete assigned order
DELETE {{base}}/api/assign/assigned-orders/1

