# ============================================================
# 13. DELIVERY FEE  (/api/deliveryFee, /api/delivery-pricing)
# ============================================================

### 13.1 Calculate delivery fee (standard — dropoff coords + weight + quantity)
POST {{base}}/api/deliveryFee/delivery-fee/calculate-fee
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dropoff_lat": 9.00,
  "dropoff_lng": 38.70,
  "weight_kg": 10,
  "quantity": 2
}

###

### 13.2 Update fee config (admin)
PUT {{base}}/api/deliveryFee/delivery-fee/update-fee-config
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startup_fee": 150,
  "per_km_fee": 15,
  "per_quantity_fee": 5
}

###

### 13.3 Calculate delivery pricing (telalaki / heavy goods — by weight + dropoff coords)
POST {{base}}/api/delivery-pricing/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "weight_kg": 200,
  "dropoff_lat": 9.00,
  "dropoff_lng": 38.70
}

###

### 13.4 Calculate from cart
POST {{base}}/api/delivery-pricing/calculate-from-cart
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cart_items": [{"product_id": 1, "quantity": 2, "weight_kg": 1.5}],
  "distance_km": 10
}

###

### 13.5 Get pricing matrix (public)
GET {{base}}/api/delivery-pricing/matrix

###

###


